  "title": "Gujarat farmers protest land acquisition for highway expansion",
  "summary": "Gujarat farmers have protested land acquisition for a highway expansion, citing concerns over the project's environmental and socio-economic impacts. A local government initiative is underway to acquire land in Singur district, a day after Union Minister Sukanta Majumdar announced the construction of a truck manufacturing plant there.",
